<title>SOUTH KOREA: Choil Paper to sell 37,970 own shares.</title>
<headline>Choil Paper to sell 37,970 own shares.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choil Paper Co Ltd said on Saturday it would sell 37,970 of its own common shares on November 6-30 to raise operating funds.</p>
<p>Shares would be sold in the Seoul stock exchange at the closing price of the previous trading day.</p>
<p>Choil Paper would hold none of its own common shares after the sales, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Choil closed Saturday 800 won higher at 15,400.</p>
<p>Dongwon Securities will arrange the sales.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
